23:When attached to a session, tmux mouse mode owns normal drag gestures. Hold
24-Option while dragging in iTerm2. Hold Shift while dragging in most Linux
25-terminals and Windows Terminal, including WSL2. This bypasses application mouse
26-reporting and lets the terminal perform native selection.
27-
28-If your terminal has no selection bypass, disable mouse mode for new and
29-reconnected sessions:
30-
31-```toml
32:[tmux]
33-mouse = false
